\beta_{\rm QS}(x)
=[J_n(x)=-1]+[n\equiv5\pmod8]\,[x\text{ odd}]
\pmod2.
\]
When \(n\equiv5\pmod8\) and \(x\) is odd, \(v_2(x^2-n)=2\).

**It is false outside that scope.** For
